    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what's the point of \"shaping who i am\" when everything i valued is dead? i'm 45. i can't start over. i can't build a new life from zero. it's like I poured every single ounce of my soul into a vessel that just shattered. i'm just sitting here looking at the pieces and realizing there's nothing left to salvage. it feels more like a debt than a life at this point.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
