      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel this way when something so significant has been lost; the pain of that kind of devastation is immense. However, rather than seeing it as a debt, perhaps you can view the past effort as a history of strength and resilience you possess. Even when the structure collapses, the capacity to rebuild or create something different remains within you. Please allow yourself the space to grieve this loss, but remember that your inherent worth is not tied to any single outcome.",
      "source": "target",
