    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuilding sounds like a joke. i don't have the energy for another 20 years of fighting. it's just math at this point. i put in all this time and got nothing back. it feels like i'm just staying in a game that's already over, just to keep losing. why is there any logic in continuing to play when the board is empty?",
